# BATT1 (VIN_RIGHT) and BATT2 (VIN_LEFT) get their MONITOR/VOLT_PIN/VOLT_MULT
# from hwdef.dat compile-time defaults (HAL_BATT_*/HAL_BATT2_*). BATT3/4/5
# have no such hwdef mechanism in AP_BattMonitor, so they're set here instead.
#
# VOLT_MULT values are theoretical, from schematic divider resistors -
# not yet recalibrated against measured hardware (see WING CPC's
# BATT3/BATT4 recalibration precedent).

BATT3_MONITOR 3
BATT3_VOLT_PIN 6
BATT3_VOLT_MULT 4.0
BATT3_CURR_PIN -1

BATT4_MONITOR 3
BATT4_VOLT_PIN 8
BATT4_VOLT_MULT 4.0
BATT4_CURR_PIN -1

BATT5_MONITOR 3
BATT5_VOLT_PIN 7
BATT5_VOLT_MULT 1.5
BATT5_CURR_PIN -1
